OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire, we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feelgood stories across
OL,8,Four region - and we like to shout about
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FThis week, among other stories, we are
OL,12,Ffeaturing the end of BBC Look North's
OL,13,FChildren in Need challenge, a veteran
OL,14,Fspotlighting the stories behind war
OL,15,Fgraves, and a Premier League footballer
OL,16,Fencouraging kids to have a kick about.
OL,18,FBBC Look North's Amy Garcia and Lindsey
OL,19,FBurrow received a heroes' welcome in
OL,20,FWakefield on Friday, as they completed
OL,21,Fthe Push for Pudsey Children in Need
OL,22,Fchallenge.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
